GraphQL Introspection queries reveal schema details via `__schema` introspection. Attackers query:
```graphql
{
  __schema {
    types {
      name
      fields {
        name
        args { name type { name } }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
Hidden mutations (e.g., `__resolveType`) are exposed via type introspection. Tools: `graphql-cli`:
```bash
graphql get-schema --endpoint https://api.target.com/graphql
```
Mitigation: Disable introspection in production via `apollo-server`:
```javascript
const server = new ApolloServer({
  introspection: false,
  plugins: [ApolloServerPluginLandingPageDisabled()]
});
```
Real-world breach: CVE-2021-41776 (Apache GraphQL) allowed path traversal due to improper field resolution.

